<title>INDIA: India SBI 1996/97 results on June 19.</title>
<headline>India SBI 1996/97 results on June 19.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The directors of State Bank of India (SBI) will meet on June 19 to finalise its audited results for the year to March 31, 1997, SBI said in a statement to the Bombay Stock Exchange on Saturday.  </p>
<p>The board meeting will be held in the eastern city of Calcutta, the bank said.</p>
<p>In the interim period it will not be furnishing unaudited results for the second half of 1996/97 (April-March), the statement added.</p>
<p>SBI is India's largest commercial bank. It had raised $400 million through a global depositary receipts issue last year.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
